DESCRIPTION:Pride Parenting is a dedicated space for LGBTQIA\\+ parents an
 d caregivers to connect\, share experiences\, and build community. Designe
 d for adults raising children\, this group offers a welcoming environment 
 where Queer families can find support\, exchange resources\, and celebrate
  joy together.\n\nEach session centers on connection\, learning\, and stre
 ngthening the bonds within our community. Pride Parenting is a confidentia
 l\, closed group with limited space to ensure safety and meaningful partic
 ipation.\n\nWhen: Starting March 3\, 2026 6 weekly group meetings Tuesdays
  5:30pm - 7:30pm\n\nWhere: Keystone Therapy & Training Services\, 4415 Son
 oma Hwy. Santa Rosa\, CA 95409\n\nCost: Free for Partnership Medi-Cal part
 icipants\, $25 per session \\($150 total\\) for Private Insurance particip
 ants
