SUMMARY:The Law of AMRA
DESCRIPTION:Rosicrucians AMORC\, Santa Rosa\, CA\nTopic:\n**The Law of AMR
 A -**\n**Atrium Group Ritual presented by Frank Nappi\, F.R.C.**\n\nThe La
 w of AMRA beautifully explains the concept of service to humanity and poin
 ts to giving as a way of spiritual unfoldment.\n\nAll AMORC members\, thei
 r families and friends of the Rosicrucian Order are welcome to attend. We 
 are delighted to have you join us in ritual and discussion.\n\n• Importa
 nt to know- Doors open for members and non-member friends of the Rosicruci
 an Order by 6:30 PM. Please arrive early! The Atrium Group ritual begins p
 romptly at 7:00 PM. Members - please bring your credentials or membership 
 dues receipt.\n\nFollowing the meeting:\n1st Tuesday- Mystical Seekers Ser
 ies Public Presentation at 8:00 PM\n\nThe Santa Rosa Pronaos operates unde
 r the law of AMRA. You may give as your heart and mind direct you.\n\nThe 
 Santa Rosa Pronaos is a 501c3 educational non-profit\, an affiliated body 
 of the Rosicrucian English Grand Lodge for the Americas and the Caribbean.
