SUMMARY:Tumult to Tranquility
DESCRIPTION:Rosicrucians AMORC\, Santa Rosa\, CA\n**Tumult to Tranquility*
 *\nwritten for the Rosicrucian Digest by Chris. R. Warnken\, F.R.C.\n\nThe
 re can be no doubt that now\, as always\, we are living in tumultuous time
 s. Humans have always sought peace\, but the tumult from which we are alwa
 ys trying to escape was not thrust upon us\; we have often created it for 
 ourselves! In this presentation\, the author states that we are dual being
 s -both physical and spiritual and he reveals the Rosicrucian technique fo
 r seeking a balanced existence by developing an inner life of tranquility.
 \n\nFree Admission - Open to the Public\nPresented by Dan Villalva\, F.R.C
 .\, archivist for the Santa Rosa Pronaos.\n\nAbout the Santa Rosa Pronaos\
 nWe hold a monthly public presentation on mystical or metaphysical topics 
 as a public service. The topics and speakers vary and no previous knowledg
 e or experience is required. Just bring an open mind and heart.\n\nThe San
 ta Rosa Pronaos doesn't charge for admission. We operate under the law of 
 AMRA. You may give as your heart and mind direct you.\n\nThe Santa Rosa Pr
 onaos is a 501c3 educational non-profit\, an affiliated body of the Rosicr
 ucian English Grand Lodge for the Americas and the Caribbean.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/amorc-santa-rosa-pronaos/events/31332
 1212/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260212T045107Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260212T045107Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
