BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.keystone.love/events-programs/hey-dad-support-group", "Press Democrat": "https://www.keystone.love/events-programs/hey-dad-support-group"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.keystone.love/events-programs/hey-dad-support-group"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Hey Dad! - A Peer Support Group for Fathers
DTSTART;TZID=PST;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260304T173000
DTEND;TZID=PST;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260304T193000
UID:260106gh_9f21780Cxa6xoI69vmw
DESCRIPTION:Hey Dad! is an in-person peer support group where fathers and 
 male caregivers can build on their strengths\, share experiences\, and sup
 port one another through the ups and downs of parenting.\n\nLed by a train
 ed Facilitators\, this group offers a space to explore the funny\, confusi
 ng\, uncertain\, and mysterious experiences of fatherhood in a supportive 
 environment.\n\nWhen: Starting March 4\, 2026 6 weekly group meetings Wedn
 esdays 5:30pm - 7:30pm\n\nWhere: Keystone Therapy & Training Services\, 44
 15 Sonoma Hwy. Santa Rosa\, CA 95409\n\nCost: Free for Partnership Medi-Ca
