 )\n\n17\\+\n\n$265 – Registration Cost $30 – Materials Fee $295 – To
 tal Registration Cost\n\nA continuation of our intermediate course\, this 
 upper level / advanced course will help you hone your throwing skills in t
 he studio.\n\nWhat you’ll Create\n\nThis session is designed for people 
 who have already taken multiple wheel throwing courses. A continuation of 
 our intermediate course\, this upper level / advanced course will help you
  hone your throwing skills through more complex demos\, and nuanced approa
 ches to technical throwing. In this 8 week course\, students will dive dee
 p into developing their own unique voice as they build a technical toolset
  for the independent maker. In addition to throwing\, surface decoration t
 echniques will be explored as well as the opportunity to experiment with d
 ifferent clay bodies. With your 8 week class registration\, students recei
 ve the opportunity to purchase a studio pass for ½ off during the duratio
 n of their class. Sign ups for membership will be included in your preclas
 s email.\n\nMembership has its benefits\n\nAll Silver Memberships and abov
 e receive 10% off the registration cost for any purchase over $40. Materia
 ls fees are not discounted.\n\nBecome a member today and find community\, 
 connection\, and creativity.\n\nLocation\n\nRoom 117\, Ceramics Studio
