UID:260107GM5FoKk-MkmtqyeQrk6zwg
DESCRIPTION:Our meeting theme on January 8th is "Room to Grow." You are we
 lcome to practice your public speaking with a 1-2 minute table topic extem
 poraneous speeches from a prompt. What better way to start the New Year by
  taking the first step into confident public speaking?\n\nWe start the mee
 tings promptly at 12:05pm\, so come early to sign in and mingle. We are a 
 small group and meet twice monthly. It's not overwhelming and there's plen
 ty of chances to participate.\n\nReady to boost your public speaking skill
 s? Come hang out with fellow enthusiasts and practice in a super friendly\
 , in-person setting. Whether you're a newbie or a pro\, Downtown Toastmast
 ers is all about growing your confidence and connecting with awesome peopl
 e. Don't miss out on a great chance to speak up and shine!\n\nGuests Welco
 me!
LOCATION:Glaser Center
URL:https://4069.toastmastersclubs.org/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
