X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/2026-north-bay-housing-action-summit/18092537/2026-03-05T13", "Press Democrat": "https://generationhousing.org/register-2026-north-bay-housing-action-summit/"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/2026-north-bay-housing-action-summit/18092537/2026-03-05T13"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:2026 North Bay Housing Action Summit
DTSTART;TZID=PST;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260305T130000
DTEND;TZID=PST;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260305T173000
UID:260210iAai1x_RFES0pU6OC96nuw
DESCRIPTION:You are Invited to the the 5th Annual North Bay Housing Action
  Summit\n\nPresented by Generation Housing | March 5\, 2026\n\nGeneration 
 Housing invites you to the 2026 North Bay Housing Action Summit\, a gather
 ing of leaders\, advocates\, and changemakers who are dedicated to advanci
 ng real housing solutions in our region. Held at The Backdrop in Santa Ros
 a\, the Summit will feature dynamic and informative speakers\, and share t
 he tools needed to create meaningful change in your community.\n\nWhat you
  can expect:\n\n● Hear more about the Housing for Healthy Communities In
 itiative.\n\n● Learn the practical steps associated with AB 1033\, which
  allows the sale of\n\nADUs as separate homes through condoization—perfe
 ct for realtors\, builders\,\n\nlawyers\, and bankers involved in ADU sale
 s\, development\, and construction.\n\n● Gain powerful communication and
  advocacy skills to support more housing\n\n\\(transferable skills you can
  use in your work and advocacy roles outside of\n\nhousing\, too!\\)\n\n
 ● Build connections with others who care about housing & community actio
 n.\n\n﻿The Housing Action Summit is designed to help you turn urgency in
 to impact and bring the changes we need for our community to thrive. The p
 rogram will include a reception designed to encourage continued discussion
  and deeper engagement in the work Generation Housing is leading throughou
 t the North Bay.\n\nRSVPs are open.\n\nTickets available on a sliding scal
 e.\n\nVisit us online at www.generationhousing.org/news/ to reserve your s
 eat
LOCATION:The Backdrop @ Becoming Independent
URL:https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/2026-north-bay-housing-
 action-summit/18092537/2026-03-05T13
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
