 kind experience. Grab your friends and come down for a night of fun\, laug
 hter\, and furry friends!\n\nThis month\, we will have special guests\, a 
 musical comedy duo \, Griefcat !\n\n@griefcatpartytime on instagram\n\nGri
 efcat is a Washington\, D.C.–based musical comedy duo known for clever l
 yrics\, tight harmonies\, and genre-hopping songs that mix humor with shar
 p social commentary. Their work blends indie folk and pop with comedy\, th
 ey are an act you don't wanna miss so get your tickets now\n\nBYOB and a q
 uick reminder this event will take place outside with the animals \, so pl
 ease dress appropriately. This is a free entry show\, we will be accepting
  donations. All to support our furry friends.\n\nhttps://animalplace.org/p
 etaluma-rescue-adoption-center/\n\nLocation:\n\n70 Lynch Road\n\nPetaluma\
 , CA 94954
