SUMMARY:Thursday Pottery on the Wheel\; Intro
DTSTART;TZID=PST;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260305T180000
DTEND;TZID=PST;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260305T210000
UID:251217if0Ggh-bB0a4eLLPaIZVTQ
DESCRIPTION:Thursdays\, January 29 – March 19\, 2026 6:00 PM – 9:00 PM
 \n\nExperience Level\n\nBeginning\n\nEvent Category: Ceramics\n\nAge\\(s\\
 )\n\n17\\+\n\n$265 – Registration Cost $30 – Materials Fee $295 – To
 tal Registration Cost\n\nA class for first timers! Always wanted to dive i
 n and get your hands dirty on the wheel but didn’t know where to start? 
 This Intro course is designed for you!  The instructor guides you through
  the basic steps of throwing\, shaping\, and trimming of pottery on the wh
 eel.  This class is a great opportunity for students to hone basic techni
 ques of throwing on the wheel and expand skills in all aspects of pottery.
   Surface decoration techniques will be explored. With your 8 week class 
 registration\, students receive the opportunity to purchase a studio pass 
 for ½ off during the duration of their class. Sign ups for membership wil
 l be included in your pre class email.\n\nMembership has its benefits\n\nA
 ll Silver Memberships and above receive 10% off the registration cost for 
 any purchase over $40. Materials fees are not discounted.\n\nBecome a memb
 er today and find community\, connection\, and creativity.\n\nLocation\n\n
 Room 117\, Ceramics Studio
LOCATION:Sonoma Community Center
URL:https://sonomacommunitycenter.org/programs/thursday-pottery-on-the-whe
 el-intro/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
