  theater company that creates communities where all people move through th
 e world with compassion\, confidence\, and joy. Their evening-length exper
 ience entitled joyUS justUS takes on joy as the ultimate expression of res
 istance with embodied stories of joy collected from communities of color i
 n South Los Angeles.
