DESCRIPTION:The Journey Center is thrilled to host The Many - a Chicago-ba
 sed creative music collective\, for an evening of live music to encourage 
 and uplift our Sonoma County community.\n\nThe Many creates inclusive\, ju
 stice-grounded music that holds space for faith and doubt\, hope and lamen
 t\, questions and belonging. Their songs are honest\, deeply human\, and m
 ade to be shared together. This evening isn't about certainty or doctrine\
 , but about connection\, reflection\, and remembering that we're not alone
 .\n\nThis concert is offered on a pay-what-you-can basis ranging from $15-
 $35.\n\nFriday\, March 6th at 6:30pm
