DESCRIPTION:Come gather for a soulful Friday evening of song with MaMuse.\
 n\nIn these tender times\, we turn toward one another—toward breath\, ha
 rmony\, and the resilience that grows when voices rise together. All voice
 s are welcome—novice\, seasoned\, and everywhere in between. Come as you
  are\, with the voice you have today. Through uplifting\, community-rooted
  songs\, we’ll shape our singing into prayers for ourselves\, for one an
 other\, and for the living world.\n\nThis is a space of sanctuary and conn
 ection. Join us in opening the voice and making musical magic together.
