UID:260212fHv4rTlfhEmAOBQSCoSICg
DESCRIPTION:**A Raven on the Road Production at the Cloverdale Performing 
 Arts Center**\n\nKate\, a psychologist from Santa Fe\, unexpectedly shows 
 up at the door of her old flame\, Bo\, with a life-changing secret she is 
 reluctant to share. As she struggles with opening up to Bo\, Kate also see
 ks to reconnect with her estranged daughter who lives nearby. Brimming wit
 h humanity and humor\, *A Good Deal* is a bittersweet tale of love\, loss
 \, and family connections. Developed through the Raven Players’ ScripTea
 se program.\n\n**February 27th\, 28th\, March 1st\, 6th\, 7th\, 8th.**\n\n
 **Friday and Saturday Shows: 7:30 PM Sunday Matinee: 2:00 PM Doors open 
 30 minutes before showtime.**\n\n**Admission: Adults: $25 Student w/ID: 
 $10**
LOCATION:Cloverdale Performing Arts Center
URL:https://raventheater.org/events/a-good-deal/
