SUMMARY:Vintage Space / Flamingo
DTSTART;TZID=PST;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260306T200000
DTEND;TZID=PST;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260306T200000
UID:260220tzO-apu_9EKlce91SOi91A
DESCRIPTION:Andre Nickatina Live! The Flamingo Resort & Spa 2777 4th Stree
 t Santa Rosa\, CA 95405 March 6\, 2026 | Doors 8PM | Show 9PM | 21\\+ Spen
 d an intimate night with Andre Nickatina at Vintage Space inside the Flami
 ngo Resort & Spa. This is a rare chance to experience one of the Bay Area
 ’s most influential voices in a close-up club setting\, where every lyri
 c lands and the energy stays raw and personal. Known for his unmistakable 
 flow\, cult-classic catalog\, and deep West Coast roots\, Andre Nickatina 
 brings his signature presence to Santa Rosa for a special evening that fee
 ls less like a stadium show and more like being in the room with the music
  itself. Expect a focused\, high-vibe performance designed for fans who ap
 preciate the nuance\, storytelling\, and grit that define his legacy. Spec
 ial hotel room rate for ticket buyers \\(see discussion\\). Join us overni
 ght for a fun gathering of Nickatina fans. Tickets: $55 Early Bird $60 Gen
 eral Admission Tickets only available at: www.andrenickatina.com www.vinta
 gespacesr.com www.eventbrite.com NO PROFESSIONAL PHOTOGRAPHY About the Ven
 ue: Vintage Space is a retro-futuristic music lounge hosting a cosmic arra
 y of live music\, dancing\, DJ’s\, and special events. Originally built 
 in 1957\, a time when the public’s imagination was captivated by the daw
 n of the space race – Vintage Space melds the past with a bright tomorro
 w. A bastion of good vibes\, far-out sounds and stellar cocktails that’s
  been sending it since Sputnik. All sales are final and nonrefundable. Tic
 kets may be transferred to another guest at no charge. Credits may be issu
 ed only with management approval if the request is made more than 48 hours
  before showtime and the event is not sold out. Within 24 hours of showtim
 e\, no credits or refunds will be issued. If a show is canceled or postpon
 ed\, guests may choose a full refund or credit. Tickets purchased from uno
 fficial third-party outlets are not valid and cannot be verified by our bo
 x office. We are not responsible for issues related to third-party ticket 
 purchases. Please contact the original point of purchase directly.
LOCATION:Flamingo Resort & Spa
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/1167148318835057/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
