X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Uptowntheatrenapa": "https://www.uptowntheatrenapa.com/event/jam-cellars-presents-neko-case-neon-grey-midnight-green-tour/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:uptowntheatrenapa
X-SOURCE:Uptowntheatrenapa
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260306T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260306T200000
DTSTAMP:20260302T145213
CREATED:20251209T170015Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20251209T170015Z
UID:25460-1772827200-1772827200@www.uptowntheatrenapa.com
SUMMARY:JaM Cellars Presents Neko Case - Neon Grey Midnight Green Tour
DESCRIPTION:March 6\, 2026\nPURCHASE TICKETS HERE  \nDoors 7pm/ Show 8pm\nAges: 12+ \nSinger\, songwriter\, music producer\, visual artist\, and writer Neko Case is the consummate career artist — fearless and versatile\, with a fierce work ethic and a constant drive to search deeper within herself for creative growth. “One of America’s best and most ambitious singer-songwriters” (Rolling Stone) and “essentially peerless” (NPR)\, Case has long been revered as one of music’s most influential artists\, whose authenticity\, lyrical storytelling\, and sly wit have endeared her to a legion of critics\, musicians\, and lifelong fans. \nIn addition to numerous acclaimed and GRAMMY-nominated solo records\, Case is a founding member of Canadian supergroup The New Pornographers. She is the author of The New York Times bestselling memoir The Harder I Fight the More I Love You and the weekly Substack newsletter Entering The Lung\, and is currently composing the musical theater adaptation of the Academy Award-winning motion picture Thelma & Louise. Her upcoming album\, Neon Grey Midnight Green is arriving on September 26 via Anti Records.
URL:https://www.uptowntheatrenapa.com/event/jam-cellars-presents-neko-case-neon-grey-midnight-green-tour/
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.uptowntheatrenapa.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/NC_1200x800.jpg
END:VEVENT
