DESCRIPTION:In this beginner class\, students will learn the foundational 
 steps\, posture\, and body movement that make Kizomba both elegant and acc
 essible. You’ll practice how to connect with the music\, build comfort i
 n partner connection\, and develop the confidence to dance socially.\n\nNo
  partner is needed to join! Whether you are brand new to partner dancing o
 r looking to add a new style to your repertoire\, this class will give you
  the tools to start enjoying Kizomba on the dance floor right away.\n\nDro
 p-in fee is $20 and no partner is required.\n\nDate & Time: Fridays @ 8:30
 PM – 9:30PM\n\nInstructor: Tyler Crandall\n\nAddress: 4140 Redwood Highw
 ay \\#8 San Rafael\, CA\n\nNote: Arrive 10 minutes before. No floor markin
 g shoe soles allowed.\n\nSocial dancing after class 9:30 pm – 11:30 pm
LOCATION:4140 Redwood Highway #8 San Rafael
URL:https://salsadancemarin.com/kizomba/
