DTEND;TZID=PST;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260307T013000
UID:260226hpMeDOP2dEy4WSk1hpmRbA
DESCRIPTION:Neon Night – 70s to Now Dance Party\n\nFeaturing DJ Sleeples
 s Barrel Proof Lounge | Downtown Santa Rosa\n\nWhen the comedy ends\, the 
 lights shift.\n\nAt 10PM\, DJ Sleepless takes control for Neon Night — a
  high-energy dance party spanning decades of pure movement. From the bass 
 lines of ABBA to the guitar fire of Prince\, with a little Britney sparkle
  in between\, this is wall-to-wall dance floor fuel from the 70s to now.\n
 \nDJ Sleepless keeps the pulse steady and the floor moving — blending di
 sco grooves\, 80s synth\, 90s pop chaos\, and modern dance anthems into on
 e seamless\, sweat-ready night.\n\nThis isn’t background music. It’s a
  dance floor.\n\nNo cover. No standing around. No backs on the wall.\n\n 
 Beer\, wine & Soju cocktails flowing  Comedy at 8PM  Neon Night with DJ 
 Sleepless at 10PM  FREE entry\n\n501 Mendocino Avenue\, Downtown Santa Ro
 sa.\n\nCome for the laughs. Stay for the sweat.\n\nCheck out **www.Barrel
 ProofLounge.com** for all sorts of good times ahead!
LOCATION:Barrel Proof Lounge
URL:https://www.eventbrite.com/e/neon-night-70s-to-now-dance-party-with-dj
 -sleepless-tickets-1984029471558?aff=oddtdtcreator
