X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Santa Rosa Junior College": "https://calendar.santarosa.edu/event/15534-high-school-undocuadvocate"}
X-SOURCE-ID:srjc
X-SOURCE:Santa Rosa Junior College
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260307T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260307T113000
LOCATION:Zoom
SUMMARY:High School UndocuAdvocate
DESCRIPTION:When undocumented\, or mixed-status\, students reach out for 
 help\, will you know how to guide them? If you've ever wondered what to s
 ay\, this training is for you.  &#160\;  California law protects undocume
 nted students. It also calls on public schools to support their academic\
 , professional\, and technical development. That means all of us: Teacher
 s\, Staff\, Administrators.Learn the legal rights of undocumented student
 s under AB 540\, AB 130/131 and beyond  Identify key community and campus
 -based resources  Practice how to respond when students share their statu
 s (or when they don't)    SRJC Undocu • Immigrant • Dream Center invi
 tes you to join these virtual professional development series designed fo
 r those who work with undocumented students.Register Here (https://events
 .zoom.us/ev/Ahz-B7CliG8ado65n_JxkAI5BUBdbdgWsOogJt7XlX7xGO1ZlMqG~AobDNtoh
 2Zqv32C1wkMMx3U8MfI-vUdIqGvFPpqmRPShk89RNu2OD7TaOA)  For more information
 \, visit the SRJC Undocu • Immigrant • Dream Center Website (https://
 dream.santarosa.edu/workshops-events-2025-2026)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  When undocumented\, or mixed-status\, s
 tudents reach out for help\, will you know how to guide them? If you've e
 ver wondered what to say\, this training is for you.</p><p>  &#160\;</p><
 p>  California law protects undocumented students. It also calls on publi
 c schools to support their academic\, professional\, and technical develo
 pment. That means all of us: Teachers\, Staff\, Administrators.</p><ul><l
 i>Learn the legal rights of undocumented students under AB 540\, AB 130/1
 31 and beyond  </li><li>Identify key community and campus-based resources
   </li><li>Practice how to respond when students share their status (or w
 hen they don't)  </li></ul><p>  SRJC Undocu • Immigrant • Dream Cente
 r invites you to join these virtual professional development series desig
 ned for those who work with undocumented students.</p><p><a href="https:/
 /events.zoom.us/ev/Ahz-B7CliG8ado65n_JxkAI5BUBdbdgWsOogJt7XlX7xGO1ZlMqG~A
 obDNtoh2Zqv32C1wkMMx3U8MfI-vUdIqGvFPpqmRPShk89RNu2OD7TaOA" target="_blank
 " rel="noopener">Register Here</a></p><p>  For more information\, visit t
 he <a href="https://dream.santarosa.edu/workshops-events-2025-2026" targe
 t="_blank" rel="noopener">SRJC Undocu • Immigrant • Dream Center Webs
 ite</a></p>
