UID:610c5bba308583ac797e85b4e157696d@sonomalibrary.org
DESCRIPTION:If you can carry it in\, we can try to fix it! Members of Zero
  Waste Sonoma and the Reuse Alliance will be on hand to help repair your s
 tuff for free!
LOCATION:Cloverdale Meeting Room at Cloverdale Regional Library
