BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Press Democrat": "https://www.reusealliance.org/events/cloverdale-repair-fair"}
X-SOURCE-ID:pressdemocrat
SUMMARY:Cloverdale Repair Fair
DTSTART;TZID=PST;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260307T130000
DTEND;TZID=PST;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260307T160000
UID:260207D73WpyD_Ukyk5HZoC3apkg
DESCRIPTION:Do you have a lamp\, small appliance\, textile\, or bike in ne
 ed of repair?\n\nBring it to the Repair Fair!\n\nVolunteers and specialize
 d repair professionals will be on-hand to repair\\* your items.  We ask 
 that you stay with your item while it's being fixed\, so you can learn tip
 s for future maintenance\, how to shop for repairable goods\, and even how
  to repair things yourself!  \n\nIf you’d like to bring an item to r
 epair\, please register the item here: https://www.reusealliance.org/rf-re
 g . \\(Pre-registering allows us to prepare for your item!\\)\n\nThis is a
  free public event.\n\n\\*We cannot guarantee your item\\(s\\) will be rep
 aired\, depending on the existing damage or breakage\, ability of voluntee
 r fixers\, and availability of materials for repair. Note we cannot work o
 n microwaves and we can’t repair cell phones but we’re happy to refer 
 you to local professionals who can. In addition\, the textile department i
 s not able to perform the following:\n\nReplacing zippers\n\nRepairing sho
 es\, leather\, or vinyl materials\n\nPerforming alterations \\(making garm
 ents bigger/smaller\\)\n\nReplacing rivets/grommets\n\nHemming certain fab
 rics \\(stretchy fabric\, sleek/luxury fabrics e.g. prom dresses\\)\n\nIf 
 you are in need of garment hemming\, we require that you please pin your g
 arment to the desired length before you arrive.\n\nJoin Us!\n\nDoes fixing
  things sound like a fun way to spend a Saturday afternoon?  Or want to h
 elp out in other ways?  We need you!\n\nEmail volunteer@reusealliance.org
  or sign up here: https://www.reusealliance.org/rf-volunteer
LOCATION:Cloverdale Library
URL:https://www.reusealliance.org/events/cloverdale-repair-fair
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
