DESCRIPTION:"Nature's Delights" features a select range of experienced and
  new artists in our community\, and celebrates the bounty of talent and ar
 t in our region. See the creative interpretations of our theme through bea
 utifully painted and hand-crafted art. Enjoy tasty treats in an uplifting 
 and welcoming atmosphere. Join the fun in our group art project\, all mate
 rials are provided and all ages welcome. Showstoppers Artist Collective ga
 llery features the creations of local artists in an uplifting community ga
 llery and gathering place. Located in the cozy Co-Create space\; boutique 
 art\, photographs\, gifts and workshops are featured alongside a stunning 
 space to connect and create\, while bringing art to life. Beautifully hand
 -crafted\, painted and homespun art will take center stage\; as enlighteni
 ng and educational art workshops\, talks and groups aim to inspire. Connec
 t with others in our community to form valuable friendships and let your h
 eart and imagination fly. Come take a picture with Cassie\, the life-like 
 dog you simply have to see to believe. Woof!
