DESCRIPTION:Healdsburg Dance Collective presents its fourth annual show **
 *MOSAIC: A Fundraiser For Dance Education*** at the Raven Performing Arts 
 Theater in Healdsburg on Saturday\, March 7th from 6:00 -7:30 p.m. The sho
 w will feature live dance performances by UPside Dance Company\, HDC Youth
  Dancers with Young at Heart Theatre\, and dance films from San Francisco 
 Dance Film Festival. All ages welcome. Afterparty onstage with DJ Glitterf
 ox.\n\n**Tickets:**$35 adults\, $20 youth/students\n\nAll proceeds benefit
  dance education in Healdsburg through our scholarship program. Funds are 
 available to support dancers of all levels and ages\, from budding newcome
 rs to  to college-age pre-professionals. HDC has thus far distributed ove
 r $11\,000 in tuition assistance\, thanks to the generous support of the c
 ommunity. \n\nA special VIP Pre-Show Wine & Cheese Mingle will be held at
  **Bloodroot Winery Tasting Room** across from the theater from 5:00 - 6:0
 0 p.m. preceding the show with reserved premium seating for VIPs ($100).
LOCATION:Raven Performing Arts Theater
URL:https://www.healdsburgdancecollective.org/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
