UID:TKF/640bd014795edf4fa3769b14/455/29548440/0/0
DTSTART:20260307T180000Z
DTEND:20260308T000000Z
URL:https://tockify.com/rileystreet.art.com/detail/455/1772906400000
SUMMARY:**Cancelled** Sunlit Florals Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Instructor: Susan Sweet\nMarch 7th\, 2026\n10:00AM - 4:00PM\n
 Location: Santa Rosa Store\n$125 per class\n\nJoin Susan Sweet for an ins
 piring day of watercolors! Beginning to advanced students welcome.\n\nDur
 ing this workshop students will learn the importance of good art material
 s\, brushes\, paints\, and paper. Composition/cropping: Understanding for
 m and light source. How to transfer designs to watercolor paper. Techniqu
 es and tricks with masking fluid to obtain soft and crisp edges and textu
 res.\n\nStudents will explore basic watercolor washes & glazing technique
 s for depth and luminosity (what paints play well with others). We will a
 lso explore techniques for creating texture with spraying\, salt\, thirst
 y brush\, etc.\n\nEach student will be given two images of the piece to b
 e painted\, one color and one black and white for a value study. The imag
 e will be transferred to the watercolor paper using graphite paper\, and 
 masking fluid applied where needed. While the fluid dries we will explore
  painting simpler forms to practice graded washes and color combinations 
 to be used in the final painting. Students will observe demos as we move 
 through the painting and will receive one on one helpful guidance to gain
  skill and confidence!\n\nSusan Sweet is a local mixed media and watercol
 or artist whose work is inspired by nature.\n\nTo register\, please conta
 ct Susan Sweet by email: mailto:susansweetartist@gmail.com mailto:susansw
 eetartist@gmail.com mailto:susansweetartist@gmail.com susansweetartist@gm
 ail.com mailto:susansweetartist@gmail.com mailto:susansweetartist@gmail.c
 om or by phone (707) 367-0672.\n\n\n\n
CATEGORIES:Santa-Rosa,Watercolor
STATUS:CANCELLED
