DESCRIPTION:Kelcey Ayer is a Colombian-American artist based out of Los An
 geles\, mostly known as co-founder/singer/songwriter of Local Natives & hi
 s solo project Jaws of Love. 2025 sees Ayer leaving both projects behind t
 o welcome his first solo EP under his given name\, dropping July 18th\, ca
 lled No Sleep. His first three singles Don’t Look Down\, Different Plane
 ts\, & Ghosts of Neighborhood Dogs \\(feat. Jordana\\) were released earli
 er this year to critical praise from Uproxx\, Consequence of Sound\, and F
 lood amongst others\, plus spins on KCRW and 91X. All of his new material 
 reflects on his life-changing experience of becoming a new father.
