DESCRIPTION:Santa Rosa Creative Circle\nIn this 4-hour workshop you will:\
 n\n* Learn the proper tools and supplies to create your mosaic piece.\n* L
 earn how to cut and place tiles to create your piece so it reads properly.
 \n* Learn to grout and seal your piece.\n\nBring your own design ideas or 
 choose one from the MANY templates at The Arthaus. You can choose to hang 
 your mosaic outdoors OR indoors. If you choose indoors\, you will leave wi
 th a framed 10x10 inch piece.\n\nSee additional sample photos below. Visit
  www.arthausonbarnes.com for workshop reviews from previous mosaic student
 s.\n\nFirst time at The Arthaus? No need to feel shy\, I promise you will 
 feel right at home within minutes!\n\nPayment is due in advance via Venmo.
  925-548-8077 (text with questions).\n\nVenmo:\n@Elizabeth-Monaghan-12
