X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/virgins-to-villains-live-theatre-at-the-222/18155806/2026-03-08T14", "Press Democrat": "https://the222.org/product/virgins-vixins/"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/virgins-to-villains-live-theatre-at-the-222/18155806/2026-03-08T14"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Virgins to Villains - Live Theatre at THE 222
DTSTART;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260308T140000
DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260308T140000
UID:260219sshFkwMviEOUjiznChu8wA
DESCRIPTION:Robin Goodrin Nordli returns to THE 222 in this witty\, insigh
 tful\, and revealing one-woman show. This Oregon Shakespeare Festival vet
 eran actor draws from her experiences of performing in 61 productions of 
 30 different plays by William Shakespeare. From the Bard’s innocent virg
 ins to his vindictive villains\, Robin masterfully explores her own life 
 journey through the prism of her relationship with Shakespeare’s female
  characters.\n\nTouching\, powerful and entertaining.— Dangerous Common
  Sense\n\nSponsored by Kate & Dennis Abbe\, Randy Varney & John King\, an
 d Michael & Janet Verlander\n\nTheatre - Programmed by Aldo Billingslea an
 d Amy Kossow\n\nTHE 222 / 222 Healdsburg Avenue / Healdsburg CA
LOCATION:THE 222 / Healdsburg
URL:https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/virgins-to-villains-liv
 e-theatre-at-the-222/18155806/2026-03-08T14
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.valley-players.com/2025/11/30/the-savannah-sipping-society/", "Press Democrat": "https://www.valley-players.com/2025/11/30/the-savannah-sipping-society/"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.valley-players.com/2025/11/30/the-savannah-sipping-society/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:The Savannah Sipping Society\; a Jones Hope Wooten Comedy
DTSTART;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260308T140000
DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260308T160000
UID:260218XLpujAk51U6_XxCqXs2qvA
DESCRIPTION:**Four Southern women turn life’s curve balls into an uproar
 ious\, heartwarming journey of friendship\, laughter\, and fresh starts.**
 \n\nIn this delightful\, laugh-a-minute comedy\, four unique Southern wome
 n\, all needing to escape the sameness of their day-to-day routines\, are 
 drawn together by Fate—and an impromptu happy hour—and decide it’s h
 igh time to reclaim the enthusiasm for life they’ve lost through the yea
 rs. Over the course of six months\, filled with laughter\, hilarious misad
 ventures\, and the occasional liquid refreshment\, these middle-aged women
  successfully bond and find the confidence to jump start their new lives. 
 Together\, they discover lasting friendships and a renewed determination t
 o live in the moment—and most importantly\, realize it’s never too lat
 e to make new old friends.
LOCATION:Rutherford Grange Hall
URL:https://www.valley-players.com/2025/11/30/the-savannah-sipping-society
 /
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
