DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260308T140000
UID:2602209mUdr_7BO0CgAtFlDPncMQ
DESCRIPTION:Thirteenth Pianists Benefit Concert Sunday\, March 8\, 2026.  
   2:00 PM Reserved Seating Premium Seats  $30.   Wing Seats   $25 Youth 18
  and Under  Free     The finest artists from Lake and Mendocino Counties a
 nd from New York City come together at the grand piano all to benefit the 
 Soper Reese Theatre renovation and Lake County Friends of Mendocino Colleg
 e student scholarships. The concert will feature all the pianists on stage
  throughout the performance as they converse about their life experiences 
 and play a variety of musical selections.      This year’s musicians are
  Spencer Brewer\, Elena Casanova\, Tom Ganoung\, Elizabeth MacDougall\, Be
 n Rosenblum\, and Ed Reinhardt.
