 o wish to bring their own materials should view the supply list. You can v
 iew the full supply list here.\n\nMembership has its benefits\n\nAll Silve
 r Memberships and above receive 10% off the registration cost for any purc
 hase over $40. Materials fees are not discounted.\n\nBecome a member today
  and find community\, connection\, and creativity.\n\nLocation\n\nRoom 208
