DESCRIPTION:Mondays\, January 26 – March 9\, 2026 6:00 PM – 7:00 PM Ex
 ception: No Class February 16\n\nExperience Level\n\nBeginning\n\nEvent Ca
 tegory: Dance & Movement\n\nAge\\(s\\)\n\n18 and older\n\n$140 – Registr
 ation Cost\n\nJoin Jasmine for a 6 week series in Beginning Swing & Lindy 
 Hop! If you are brand new dancer or brand new to swing dance\, this series
  is for you! \n\nWhat you’ll Create\n\nBrand new to the town of Sonoma!
  Join Jasmine for a 6 week series in Beginning Swing & Lindy Hop! If you a
 re brand new dancer or brand new to swing dance\, this series is for you! 
 Swing is a fun social dance that is an instantly accessible way to enjoy s
 ocial dancing to swing jazz\, blues and rock and roll music. Swing is a fo
 rm of social partner dance that evolved from Lindy Hop in the 1940s\, and 
 is based in six-count patterns that are simplified forms of Lindy Hop patt
 erns. Enjoy a beautiful community of swing dancers and learn how to social
  dance. Absolutely no experience or partner needed. Simply show up\, and I
  will provide the dance partner\, as most students come alone/single. Just
  bring comfy shoes to dance in and your own water. Class is for singles an
 d couples\, alike! Everyone is welcome. We specialize in brand new dancers
 ! Dance with confidence\, build community\, and learn something new in a f
 riendly and kind environment! If you cannot make the entire series but s
 till want to join a group class\, please email or text Jasmine at \\(510\\
 ) 388-5498 to inquire how to proceed/register.\n\nLocation\n\nRoom 110
LOCATION:Sonoma Community Center
