 4fa3769ae5/690f959af72e641c8a4cfd55/scaled_1024.jpg
X-TKF-CUSTOM-PREVIEW:Instructor: Magdalena Bogart Monday\, March 9th 1:00
 pm-4:00PM Location: Santa Rosa Store $45.00 Join us for an inspiring gel 
 printing workshop with Magdalena...
