 hink you’re the funniest person in your friend group? Now’s your chanc
 e to prove it on stage!\n\nThe Show: 8 brand-new comedians perform 5-minut
 e sets. Judged live by Casey Williams\, Chelsea Bearce\, & a surprise cele
 brity guest with real-time feedback.\n\nHosted by Jon Lehre\n\nWinner rece
 ives $100\, the Pewter Mic Trophy\, and a spot on an upcoming showcase.\n\
