BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/free-estate-planning-seminar/18000450/2026-03-12T10", "Press Democrat": "https://mackaydressler.com/workshops/"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/free-estate-planning-seminar/18000450/2026-03-12T10"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Free Estate Planning Seminar
DTSTART;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260312T100000
DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260312T120000
UID:260204DR3qci1SIU2loeJc_t3cvg
DESCRIPTION:AT THIS COMPLIMENTARY PRESENTATION\, WE WILL DISCUSS SEVERAL T
 OPICS INCLUDING:\n\nOne Big Beautiful Bill Act: How the new tax law may im
 pact trusts\, estate planning\, and family succession strategies.\n\nWills
  and Living Trusts: Learn the advantages and disadvantages to both.\n\nAss
 et Protection: How to protect your assets and your family’s inheritance 
 from creditors\, divorce\, and lawsuits.\n\nLong Term Care Planning: How t
 o avoid losing your life savings.\n\nNext Spouse Protection: How to protec
 t your assets from your surviving spouse’s next spouse.\n\nProbate: What
  is it and how to prevent it.\n\nEstate Taxes: What are they\, and how to 
 minimize or eliminate.\n\nGifting to Children: How and when to gift your a
 ssets and why putting property in children’s names may be a mistake.\n\n
 Special Needs: How to provide for special needs \\(disabled\\) children an
 d grandchildren.\n\nLegacy Planning: Good planning involves more than mone
 y. Learn some powerful tools to help instill important values in younger g
 eneration family members.\n\nAnd much\, much more…
LOCATION:Mackay Dressler Law Firm
URL:https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/free-estate-planning-se
 minar/18000450/2026-03-12T10
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
