SUMMARY:"Walking in Two World: Surviving and Thriving"
DESCRIPTION:Panelists: Brijida "Brijit" Alemán\, Dr. Brenda Flyswithhawk
 s\, Jo McKay\, Sandy Sigala\, and Paul Steward.  SRJC Native colleagues w
 ill share their lived experience of navigating\, reconciling\, and thrivi
 ng within two often conflicting worldviews: traditional Indigenous cultur
 e and the dominant Western society.  For more information\, visit: https:
 //events.santarosa.edu/womxns-history-month-2026 (https://events.santaros
 a.edu/womxns-history-month-2026)&#160\;
