 nce of navigating\, reconciling\, and thriving within two often conflicti
 ng worldviews: traditional Indigenous culture and the dominant Western so
 ciety.</p><p>  For more information\, visit: <a href="https://events.sant
 arosa.edu/womxns-history-month-2026" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https
 ://events.santarosa.edu/womxns-history-month-2026</a>&#160\;</p>
