DESCRIPTION:Featured poet TBAMusic by Robin Rogers and Friends\nSinger/Son
 gwriters and Poets Creating Vibrant CommunityTwo 20-25 minute sets of musi
 c and poetry which are followed by open mic. Afterwards we mingle for conv
 ersation\, connection and light refreshments.\nDonations to support this f
 ree event are greatly appreciated.\nDonations to support this free event a
 re greatly appreciated.\nDonations to support this free event are greatly 
 appreciated.\nDonations to support this free event are greatly appreciated
 .\nHosted by Brian Martens and Simmon Factor.\nMeets the third Wednesday o
 f the month 6 – 7:30 PM\nGet together with other creatives for  an even
 ing of conversation and connection. Artists\, bring a recent piece or one 
