DESCRIPTION:March Madness Duos brings a full night of paired-up power to t
 he stage\, celebrating musical chemistry and collaboration. Each set featu
 res a unique duo\, delivering stripped-down\, high-energy performances tha
 t put connection and musicianship front and center. The night kicks off at
