 s Equinox Duo at 8pm\, and wraps up at 9pm with Nick Otis and Matt Silva. 
 Come for one set or stay for all three—it’s a fast-paced\, music-fille
 d night you won’t want to miss. Tickets $12 in advance\, $18 at the door
 . Doors open 6:30pm.
