X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Press Democrat": "https://www.finnegansmarin.com/events-calendar/", "North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.finnegansmarin.com/events-calendar/"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Press Democrat": "https://www.finnegansmarin.com/events-calendar/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:pressdemocrat
SUMMARY:Greg Lamboy - Live Every 2nd
DTSTART;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260312T190000
DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260312T210000
UID:260225_KN7hlo65kiUg-AY1nwLsw
DESCRIPTION:Greg Lamboy has called Finnegan's Marin home for over a decade
 . Every second Thursday of the month\, this Tiburon-based troubadour settl
 es into the warmly lit corner of Novato's beloved neighborhood pub and doe
 s what he does best: connects. An accomplished guitarist and award-winning
  songwriter\, Lamboy has earned his stripes across the Bay Area scene both
  as a solo artist and as frontman of Pacific Standard\, his soulful Americ
 ana band. His five acclaimed albums draw praise for melodies that are pitc
 h-perfect and lyrics that feel like they were written specifically for you
 . At Finnegan's\, a lively Irish pub and American bar and grill along a tr
 ee-lined street in downtown Novato\, Lamboy's intimate style is perfectly 
 at home. No pretense. No distance. Just a strong clear voice\, commanding 
 guitar\, and songs that\, as one critic put it\, lift you above the everyd
 ay. Come early\, grab a pint\, and let the music find you. https://greglam
 boy.com/\n\nEvery second Thursday of the month | Finnegan's Marin\, 877 Gr
 ant Ave\, Novato | Free
LOCATION:Finnegan's Marin
URL:https://www.finnegansmarin.com/events-calendar/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://salsadancemarin.com/forro-dance/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Forró Dance with Eric and Abigail
DTSTART;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260312T193000
DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260312T203000
UID:251216vWNvx7BO_kO83KvVlxIQ9w
DESCRIPTION:Get ready to connect\, spin\, and glide to the irresistible rh
 ythms of Forró! Originating in the Northeast of Brazil\, Forró is a cap
 tivating partner dance known for its close embrace\, playful steps\, and i
 nfectious\, feel-good music. It is a social dance that will enrich your li
 fe\, perfect for a night out or a casual gathering.\n\nYou Will Learn:\n\n
 The Basic Step & Close Embrace: You will master the foundational quick-qui
 ck-slow rhythm and learn how to comfortably and confidently navigate the e
 ssential close-hold connection that defines Forró.\n\nLeading & Following
  Techniques: Discover the clear\, subtle body cues required to effortlessl
 y lead your partner through turns and variations\, and how to follow with 
 grace and responsiveness.\n\nTraveling & Stationary Patterns: Learn fundam
 ental steps like the ‘Caminhada’ \\(walking step\\) and common station
 ary turns that will allow you to dance on any size floor.\n\nRhythm & Musi
 cality: Connect your movement to the distinct musical styles of Forró—f
 rom the mellow ‘Xote’ to the faster\, more energetic ‘Pé-de-Serra.
 ’\n\nThis class is perfect for anyone looking to learn a social partner 
 dance\, connect with Brazilian culture\, and enjoy a vibrant\, community a
 tmosphere. No partner or prior dance experience is required! Just bring yo
 ur enthusiasm and comfortable shoes!\n\nClass Details\n\nNote: Arrive 10 
 minutes before. No floor marking shoe soles allowed.\n\nDate & Time: Thur
