UID:260225KXtqhPTa3U61RZ-CsG-yvw
DESCRIPTION:DETAILS Presented by The Race Company\, LLC with proceeds bene
 fiting Santa Rosa Recreation & Parks\, the St. Patrick's Day 5K is an annu
 al themed run/walk race open to all ages and abilities. The race is chip-t
 imed and participants receive a commemorative finisher medal and mug. Stic
 k around after the race for the post-run celebration complete with a beer 
 or root beer\, judged costume contest\, fun activities\, sponsor giveaways
 \, and music! --- REGISTER For more information\, and to register\, visit:
  https://stpatricksday5ksantarosa.com/ --- YOUR PARTICIPATIONS SUPPORTS RE
 CREATION PROGRAMS FOR YOUTH! Proceeds from the 5K benefit the Santa Rosa R
 ecreation & Parks Scholarship Fund\, providing income qualifying individua
 ls and families with scholarships for work experience\, swim lessons\, day
  camps\, and lifeguard training classes. --- EVENT SPONSORS The Santa Rosa
  Water Department is continuing its partnership with Rec & Parks to make t
 he 5K truly "green" by kicking off Fix a Leak Week at the event! Stop by t
 he Water booth at the post-event celebration to learn about water saving r
 ebates and tips for reducing water usage in your home.
LOCATION:Old Courthouse Square Santa Rosa
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/870037139165311/
