DESCRIPTION:Join Spreckels Theatre Education Program \\(STEP\\) this winte
 r with our production class of Disney's Descendants! Based on the Disney C
 hannel Original Movie by the same name\, follows the adventures of some of
  Disney's most wicked villains. STEP provides a professional quality theat
 rical education for students ages 8-17. No prior theatrical experience req
 uired. Whether your child is interested in fine-tuning their skills\, maki
 ng new friends\, or simply just loves Disney's Descendants\, they're sure 
 to experience a winter they'll never forget.
