X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Roots Man Project: Roots Reggae Dance Music!
DTSTART;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260314T130000
DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260314T160000
UID:260223E0Ifa0pXjk6GmDV_RDE4uw
DESCRIPTION:Roots Man Project plays high energy Roots Reggae dance music! 
 We have shared stages with reggae legends: The Wailers\, Marlon Asher\, An
 thony B\, Jamaican artist Turbulence\, Midnite\, Junior Toots\, Hirie\, E.
 N. Young \\(our music producer\\)\, President Brown\, Tuff Like Iron\, Kav
 a Jah\, Triple Tree\, Arden Park Roots and more. Our non-stop energy can f
 ire up a crowd in no time and it's all feel-good positive vibes! Check out
  the Instagram pages going back to 2014 showing hundreds of happy smiling 
 faces having a great time! Food: TBD Misc: Gate opens at noon. Minors welc
 ome\, kids 12 and under are free. Well mannered and well managed puppy dog
 s are welcome in the outside venue area. We will have seating for everyone
 . Your own comfy folding chairs are welcome. You may bring your own water 
 and "light snacks." NO large catering trays\, chafing dishes\, tables\, or
  other large party supplies allowed. Must coordinate celebrations with ven
 ue. info@vinogodfather.com. NO outside alcohol of any kind! Tickets: $17 i
 n advance\, $22 at the door A $2 ticket fee is included in ticket costs bo
 ught online\, at the door\, or over the phone. This helps cover ticketing 
 costs and credit card fees. Table Reservation \\(NOT A SHOW TICKET\\). Res
 erving a table is an additional charge and comes with a bottle of wine. A 
 table reservation guarantees a table for you and your guests \\(up to 8 pe
 ople\\) and a bottle of wine for your table\, but you and your guests must
  have a GA Event Ticket to enter the event. A Table Reservation Ticket is 
 $95 plus a $5 processing fee. Get tickets
LOCATION:Vino Godfather Winery
URL:https://www.visitvallejo.com/events/upcoming-events/roots-man-project-
 roots-reggae-dance-music
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
