 rmed by Frederick Hodges\, Rodney Jackson\, Jr.\, Ken Stegmiller and Jojo 
 Thompson. They’ll be sharing some of Sondheim’s most memorable music f
 rom his many plays\, including Into the Woods\, Company\, A Funny Thing Ha
 ppened on the Way to the Forum\, West Side Story\, A Little Night Music\, 
 and Sweeney Todd.
