X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Luther Burbank Center": "https://lutherburbankcenter.org/event/whitney-cummings26/", "North Bay Bohemian": "https://lutherburbankcenter.org/event/whitney-cummings26/", "Creative Sonoma": "https://creativesonoma.org/event/outback-presents-whitney-cummings-the-big-baby-tour/"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Luther Burbank Center": "https://lutherburbankcenter.org/event/whitney-cummings26/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:luther_burbank_center
X-SOURCE:Creative Sonoma, Luther Burbank Center, North Bay Bohemian
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260314T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260314T190000
DTSTAMP:20260302T183318
CREATED:20251209T140006Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20251208T215147Z
UID:85018-1773514800-1773514800@lutherburbankcenter.org
SUMMARY:Outback Presents Whitney Cummings: The Big Baby Tour
DESCRIPTION:Back to All Shows\n\n\nOutback Presents \nWhitney Cummings: The Big Baby Tour\n\nSaturday\, March 14\, 2026\n\n7:00 pm\n\n\nBUY TICKETS \n\n\nWhitney Cummings is a comedian\, actor\, writer\, producer\, director\, and host of the hit podcast Good for You. Best known for creating and starring in the NBC series Whitney and co-creating the syndicated\, Emmy-nominated CBS comedy 2 Broke Girls\, she has become a leading voice in modern comedy. Cummings has released six stand-up specials\, including Money Shot (2010)\, I Love You (2014)\, I’m Your Girlfriend (2016)\, Can I Touch It? (2019)\, Jokes (2022)\, and her latest\, Mouthy\, which debuted on OnlyFans in November 2023. She has also appeared in numerous television series and films\, such as Good Mourning\, Studio 666\, How It Ends\, and FOX’s Accused\, further solidifying her presence on both the big and small screens. \nBeyond performing\, Cummings is a successful author and filmmaker. In 2017\, she published her memoir\, I’m Fine… And Other Lies\, and made her directorial debut with the feature adaptation of Louann Brizendine’s bestseller\, The Female Brain. She continues to create\, produce\, and perform across platforms\, bringing her sharp humor and fearless perspective to audiences worldwide. She currently lives in Los Angeles. \n\n\nPOST-SHOW VIP MEET & GREET ADD-ON \nVIP Ticket to include: \n\nPost-Show Meet & Greet & Photo with Whitney Cummings.\nMeet & Greet ticket DOES NOT include a seat for the show.\nA separate show ticket MUST be purchased to attend Meet & Greet.\n\n\n\n\nTHIRD PARTY RESELLERS\nDon’t get taken by deceptive online resellers who use bots to buy tickets and then mark up their prices. The only safe way to protect your purchase and guarantee the best seats at the lowest cost is to work directly with us: through our website\, by phone\, or at our box office in Santa Rosa. Plus\, we’re not bots. Our friendly team members are easily accessible by phone or at the box office to provide customer support.
URL:https://lutherburbankcenter.org/event/whitney-cummings26/
CATEGORIES:2026-2027 Season,Comedy
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://lutherburbankcenter.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/12/Whitney-Cummings_SquareImage_1080x1080.jpg
END:VEVENT
