SUMMARY:Eileen Ivers: Universal Roots
DTSTART;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260315T150000
DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260315T150000
UID:26022594RSjLRdf0mz1iYQa5lw7Q
DESCRIPTION:**Eileen Ivers will change the way you think about the violin.
 **\n\nGroundbreaking musical star of Riverdance\, Grammy-winning and Emmy-
 nominated\, Eileen Ivers continues to push traditional fiddling boundaries
  from a folk music staple to a fiercely fresh\, powerfully beautiful\, int
 ensely driving world stage experience. Over a career spanning more than 40
  years\, she has performed and/or toured with such diverse artists as Stin
 g\, Patti Smith\, Al Di Meola\, Hall and Oates and The Chieftains and has 
 guest-starred with the London Symphony Orchestra\, Boston Pops\, over 60 s
 ymphony orchestras to date. \n\n**Sunday\, March 15th. 3:00 PM. Doors ope
 n at 2:00 PM.**
LOCATION:The Raven Performing Arts Theater
URL:https://raventheater.org/events/eileen-ivers-universal-roots/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.bandsintown.com/e/107739533?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=287&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:UnIVERSal Roots
DTSTART;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260315T150000
DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260315T000000
UID:260224J5bDbxmyxEaR23Lyt6oUrA
DESCRIPTION:"You will remember this concert."  Grammy-winning\, Emmy-nomin
 ated Eileen Ivers and her energetic\, passionate multi-instrumentals quint
 et deliver an evening of entertaining\, intricate and joyful mix of Americ
 an roots music forged from Celtic roots. Eileen is hailed as one of the gr
 eat innovators and pioneers in the Celtic and World music genres. Eileen w
 ill change the way you think of the violin. \n\n“It is her ability to ma
 ke a show personal to each audience member that separates her from others\
 , that and her immense talent.\n\nShe brings life to her music like no oth
 er and single-handedly makes the violin cool. \n\nShe has surrounded herse
 lf with an amazingly talented band …together\, their camaraderie extends
  to their seamless efforts on stage to deliver a musical performance of th
 e highest caliber.” Kathy Stockbridge\, Journalist
LOCATION:Raven Performing Arts Theater
URL:https://www.bandsintown.com/e/107739533?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=28
 7&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
