DESCRIPTION:Out of Stock\n      \n    \n\n\n\n\nFloor Loom Weaving: Explor
 ing Lace Weave\n\n  \n    \n      \n        \n          $325.00\n        \
 n      \n    \n  \n\nThursdays\, March 19 - May 7\, 2026\; 9:30am - 12:30p
 m$325An 8 session class for new or experienced weavers. New students will 
 go through the complete process of setting up a loom and weave a simple sc
 arf or table linens using a pickup lace technique. More experienced weaver
 s are invited to explore woven pattern lace by weaving a project in a lace
  pattern such as Bronson\, Swedish\, or Huck lace. Materials not included.
  Project costs will vary. Looms provided courtesy of the Redwood Guild of 
 Fiber Arts. Instructor: Marta Shannon\, https://www.martashannon.com/\n\n\
 n\n\n\n        \n          \n            \n              Add to cart
