DESCRIPTION:Join the Napa Center for Thought and Culture as we bring Chris
  Schell from National Geographic Live to Napa!\n\nDiscover the cosmopolita
 n wildlife that shares our city alleys and backyards with Urban Ecologist 
 and National Geographic Explorer Chris Schell and find out how American hi
 story has shaped many species.
