DESCRIPTION:Sound Sessions is our monthly Friday night series where the fo
 rmat changes but the vibe stays the same: welcoming\, unpretentious\, and 
 all about bringing people together through music.\n\nCelebrate women in mu
 sic through the crackle and warmth of vinyl. March’s Sound Sessions hono
 rs Women’s History Month with a curated listening party featuring iconic
  female artists. We’ll spin selected albums\, share context and stories\
 , not as background- but as the main event. If you have an album you’d l
 ike to play and tell us what it means to you\, please bring it to share!
