SUMMARY:MP Matador Promotions Presenta Carlos Daniels: Homenaje a Juan Gabriel – Mas Vivo Que Nunca 2026
DESCRIPTION:Back to All Shows\n\n\nMP Matador Promotions Presenta\nCarlos Daniels: Homenaje a Juan Gabriel – Mas Vivo Que Nunca 2026\n\nFriday\, March 20\, 2026\n\n8:00 pm\n\n\nBUY TICKETS \nAfter four successful tours across the US\, Colombian Latin-mariachi-pop singer\, songwriter\, and producer Carlos Daniels is back with Más Vivo Que Nunca  – Juan Gabriel Tribute (More Alive Than Ever)\, a spectacle that thousands of fans across the nation are waiting for. \nKnown as one of the best interpreters of El Divo De Juarez’s music\, Daniels has conquered fans’ hearts with impressive performances at renowned venues\, including five shows at the House of Blues Mandalay Bay Casino in Las Vegas. On this new tour\, Daniels\, along with a Mariachi band\, is determined to touch your soul by reviving some of Gabriel’s greatest hits\, while delivering an unforgettable performance. Más Vivo Que Nunca – Juan Gabriel Tribute will bring you a sea of emotions and memories\, promising they will keep you singing along to every tune from the beginning until the end of the show. \n\n\n \n\nTHIRD PARTY RESELLERS\nDon’t get taken by deceptive online resellers who use bots to buy tickets and then mark up their prices. The only safe way to protect your purchase and guarantee the best seats at the lowest cost is to work directly with us: through our website\, by phone\, or at our box office in Santa Rosa. Plus\, we’re not bots. Our friendly team members are easily accessible by phone or at the box office to provide customer support.
URL:https://lutherburbankcenter.org/event/carlos-daniels26/
CATEGORIES:2025 - 2026 Season,Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://lutherburbankcenter.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/carlos-daniels-1080-x-1080.jpg
END:VEVENT
