DESCRIPTION:Get ready for an afternoon of non-stop hits and timeless class
 ics with Soul'd Out Band! This talented band will take you on a musical jo
 urney through the decades with their eclectic mix of genres and styles. Fr
 om the soulful sounds of Stevie Wonder to the upbeat rhythm of Bruno Mars\
 , they've got something for everyone. Not only that\, but they also play a
 ll your favorite top 40 hits! Whether you're a fan of pop\, rock\, hip-hop
  or R&B\, Soul'd Out Band has got you covered. So come join us and experie
 nce the musical magic of Soul'd Out! Whether you're looking for some fun i
 n the sun listening to great music\, or a romantic afternoon sipping on yo
 ur favorite wine and dancing\, this band has got you covered. Food: TBD Mi
 sc: Gate opens at noon. Minors welcome\, kids 12 and under are free. Well 
 mannered and well managed puppy dogs are welcome in the outside venue area
 . We will have seating for everyone. Your own comfy folding chairs are wel
 come. \\*You may bring your own water and "light snacks." NO large caterin
 g trays\, chafing dishes\, tables\, or other large party supplies allowed.
  Must coordinate celebrations with venue. info@vinogodfather.com. NO outsi
 de alcohol of any kind! Tickets: $17 in advance\, $22 at the door Get tick
 ets
LOCATION:Vino Godfather Winery
URL:https://www.visitvallejo.com/events/upcoming-events/sould-out-band-all
 -your-favorite-rb-hits-1
