DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260321T133000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260321T163000
SUMMARY:Corks Squared!  
DESCRIPTION:Sonoma County Women's Wine Club (SCWWC)\nWine Cork Art\n\nSAVE
  YOUR CORKS LADIES!\n\nWe are hosting a special event in March\, on Saturd
 ay the 21st at our old favorite\, K Squared Cellars. Local artist Tara Dic
 kinson will be leading us as a group through creating a cork board masterp
 iece.\n\nEvent fee ($45) includes artist instruction and your personal cor
 k art piece\, invite your friends to join us! Please bring all those corks
  you have saved and don't quite know what to do with. If you don't have an
 y\, that's fine too. Let us know in the comments section so we can bring e
 xtra.\n\nVino is made available by K Squared for a separate fee *(by the f
 light or glass)*. The owner\, Andrew\, will be on hand to serve wine and e
 ntertainment.\n\nAbout the Cellars: After spending his first 9 years in th
 e wine industry at Charles Krug Winery in St. Helena\, Andrew Moore develo
 ped a passion for crafting small lot\, premium wines. In 2010\, with a "th
 e wine glass is half full" type of attitude\, Andrew's plans for owning hi
 s own winery began with a single barrel of Russian River Pinot Noir produc
 ed at home.\n\nIn 2015 K Squared Cellars acquired winery and tasting room 
 space. That single barrel of Pinot Noir and a dream of having their own fa
 mily winery was realized!\n\nAbout the Artist: Tara Dickinson is our artis
 t and instructor. She has a background in fine arts and years of teaching 
 expressive art labs to all ages. She enjoys sharing tools to help everyone
  feel comfortable in the creative process while learning new techniques. S
 he moved to Santa Rosa in late 2021 after growing up mostly in FL and is l
 oving the California lifestyle.\n\nWear your artsy clothing\, bring your t
 hirst\, and corks for this 2-3 hour event.\n\n* Pre-payment *(via Venmo\, 
 Zelle\, or PayPal)* is required for this limited availability event. **[PL
 S REGISTER/PAY HERE!](https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdHYNFReJbh
 lLGQh0_wl4dEJZlF3E4nmEobQzB2W93XO7tz9g/viewform?usp=publish-editor)**\n* M
 aximum of 20 people\, **guests welcome.**\n* We suggest dressing warmly or
  in layers as the cellar will be a bit cold at this time.\n\nThe event sta
 rts promptly at 1:30 pm.\nPlease be a little bit early to get settled in w
 ith your wine and supplies. Tara will follow up with everyone who RSVP's '
 Yes' to complete payment through her above link.\n\nWe look forward to see
 ing you all for this fun event in March!\nCheers!\n\\- Joleen and Dai
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/sonoma-county-womens-wine-club/events
 /313390399/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260216T223019Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260216T223019Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
