X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Riley Street Art Supply": "https://tockify.com/rileystreet.art.com/detail/416/1774114200000"}
X-SOURCE-ID:rileystreet_art
X-SOURCE:Riley Street Art Supply
UID:TKF/640bd014795edf4fa3769b14/416/29568570/0/0
DTSTART:20260321T173000Z
DTEND:20260321T223000Z
URL:https://tockify.com/rileystreet.art.com/detail/416/1774114200000
SUMMARY: Drawing Daffodils with Colored Pencil
DESCRIPTION:Instructor: Victoria A. Kochergin\nMarch 21\, 2026\n10:30 - 3
 :30\nLocation: Santa Rosa\nFee: $95.00\nWe know March has arrived when da
 ffodils start springing up from the earth. Like trumpeters\, they are ann
 ouncing winter is over and spring is here! Even after they have fallen to
  the ground heavy from rain\, they muster up the strength to once again s
 tand tall. Come join this class and capture their cheerful\, bright spiri
 t using colored pencil. Class will include demonstrations\, exercises\, t
 echniques and hands-on drawing time. All levels are welcome. Instruction 
 will be structured in a way that will address the needs of the attendees.
 \nMaterials list to be mailed once registration and payment is received.\
 nTo register\, please contact Victoria at kochergi@sonic.net mailto:koche
 rgi@sonic.net or (707) 479-3336.\nVictoria A. Kochergin is a professional
  botanical artist who works both with colored pencil and acrylics. Her ar
 twork has been exhibited in solo and group shows in galleries\, wineries\
 , botanical gardens\, international shows and on Alcatraz. She is a membe
 r of the American Society of Botanical Artists and the Northern Society o
 f Botanical Artists. For more information about Victoria\, please visit h
 er website at http://www.victoriakochergin.com/
CATEGORIES:Santa-Rosa,Botanical,Colored-Pencil
X-TKF-FEATURED-IMAGE:https://d3flpus5evl89n.cloudfront.net/640bcf85795edf
 4fa3769ae5/677b0f29c1c9522556ca3bbd/scaled_384.jpg
X-TKF-CUSTOM-PREVIEW:Instructor: Victoria A. Kochergin March 21\, 2026 10
 :30 - 3:30 Location: Santa Rosa Fee: $95.00 We know March has arrived whe
 n daffodils start springing up...
LOCATION:Rileystreet Art Supply\,103 Maxwell Ct\, Santa Rosa\, CA 95401\,
  USA
