DESCRIPTION:The Aznavoorian Sisters have been performing together since ea
 rly childhood. They performed while quite young with the Chicago Symphony 
 Orchestra on a live PBS broadcast. They draw on their Armenian heritage fo
 r an important part of their repertoire and have worked with many of the w
 orld’s leading composers. The program \\(cello and piano\\) will include
  music by Komitas Vartabed\, Debussy\, Manuel de Falla\, Brahms and Piatig
 orski.\n\nSponsored by Dr. Jed Weissberg and Steve Taylor & Lori Sarkisian
 \n\nClassical - Programmed by Gary McLaughlin\n\nTHE 222 / 222 Healdsburg 
 Avenue / Healdsburg CA
