DESCRIPTION:Soaring harmonies\, rootsy grooves\, and high-energy tributes\
 , The Fargo Brothers deliver nonstop rock\, blues & Americana. The Fargo B
 rothers are an award-winning rock\, blues\, and Americana band celebrated 
 for their soaring vocal harmonies and tight\, electrifying ensemble playin
 g. Their high-energy shows feature crowd-pleasing medley tributes to legen
 ds like The Beatles\, Rolling Stones\, Tom Petty\, ZZ Top\, Stevie Ray Vau
 ghan\, John Hiatt\, and Delbert McClinton. Blending these classics seamles
 sly with a deep catalog of original songs\, The Fargo Brothers deliver a n
 onstop\, fun-filled performance that spans genres and generations\, bringi
 ng the stage to life from the first note to the last. BUY TICKETS IN ADVAN
 CE AND SAVE! ZONE A: $25 ZONE B: $20 ZONE C: $15 Tickets at the door: $25 
 \\(Zone C only\\) Showtime 7:30pm\, doors open 6:30pm Our kitchen is open 
 and serving our All New Menu from the time doors open until end of intermi
 ssion.
LOCATION:The California
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/1385718776163625/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
