DESCRIPTION:Sol Horizon returns to Vintage Space inside The Flamingo Resor
 t in Santa Rosa on SATURDAY\, MARCH 21ST!\n\nSol Horizon has been Sonoma C
 ounty’s premier reggae band for the past 25 years. The band was voted 
 “Best Band” in the North Bay Bohemian’s “Best of the North Bay” 
 Reader’s Picks in 2022 and 2023\, as well as “Best Reggae Band” in t
 he North Bay 9 times\, including the last 5 years in a row and 8 of the pr
 evious 9 years. The band is renowned for its energetic live performances a
 nd powerful lyrical content\, which focuses on themes of peace\, positivit
 y\, community\, sustainability\, and the revitalizing power of nature. The
  band members are deeply rooted in and nurtured by their dynamic local com
 munity\, with strong ties to the arts and culture of Sonoma County\, as we
 ll as its delicate natural splendor.
LOCATION:Vintage Space
URL:https://www.bandsintown.com/e/107943163?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=28
 7&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event
