SUMMARY:Therapeutic Group Hypnosis
DTSTART;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260322T140000
DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260322T160000
UID:260303yFV83k2dN0GKzfSBhzWRhA
DESCRIPTION:Guided into the calm presence of the Self\, you’ll understan
 d protective patterns\, meet vulnerable inner parts with curiosity instead
  of shame\, and gently release old emotional burdens.\n\nThrough inner dia
 logue and symbolic repair\, exiled parts are welcomed back as strengths—
 supporting deeper self-acceptance\, integration\, and emotional freedom. 
  You will be lead through this experience in a light hypnotic trance that
  is very relaxing and allows for accessing deeper layers of the subconscio
 us mind.\n\n**Eostar will close the group hypnotherapy session with a soun
 d bath\, enveloping everyone is a sonic embrace of heart-bliss.**\n\nRetur
 n at 5 PM and join Eostar to further deepen into your heart-bliss during h
 er Sound Odyssey.\n\n**SOUND ODYSSEY**\n\n**About EESystem™**\n\nThe EES
 ystem™ is a ecologically & environmentally safe system used by individua
 ls\, doctors\, and therapists as well as Meditation and Wellness Centers t
 o improve human development and psychological well-being.  Decades of do
 cumented research on the EESystem™ shows people experience improved immu
 ne function\, relief from pain\, detoxification\, elevated moods\, increas
 ed energy\, and much more.\n\n**About Eostar**\n\nEostar Kamala is a multi
 faceted healer and musician\, specializing in therapeutic hypnosis\, trans
 formational shadow work\, and sound healing. With certifications from the 
 Hypnosis Motivation Institute as a Master Hypnotist and Hypnotherapist\, s
 he blends her extensive education—including breathwork facilitation and 
 shamanic training—with her passion for guiding others through their inne
 r journeys.\n\nHer spiritual awakening began at 19 in Hungary\, ignited by
  the wisdom of a local healer. This transformative experience led her to e
 xplore various healing modalities\, ultimately culminating in the founding
  of “Shadow Into Light” Hypnotherapy. Eostar’s artistry reflects her
  journey\; from sacred music performances to visual art representing her i
 nner landscapes\, she channels universal love through every medium.\n\nNow
  based in Mount Shasta’s energy vortex\, Eostar continues to evolve as a
  teacher and facilitator of plant medicine ceremonies while sharing her de
 votional music with the world. Her mission is to empower others to embrace
  their own paths toward healing and self-discovery.\n\nDiscover more about
  the Eostar’s service to humanity at: Eostar.net/hypnotherapy/
LOCATION:Energy Wave Center 
URL:https://energywavecenter.com/eostar/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
