X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.northbayoa.org/", "Press Democrat": "https://www.northbayoa.org/"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.northbayoa.org/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Overeaters Anonymous (OA) Newcomer Meeting in Santa Rosa
DTSTART;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260322T160000
DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260322T170000
UID:260212zxv0Kh3csUq0wCZqZNUPgw
DESCRIPTION:**Is Food a Problem for You? You Are Not Alone.**\n\nOvereater
 s Anonymous (OA) is a fellowship of people who support each other in recov
 ering from compulsive eating and food behaviors. If you feel you have a pr
 oblem with food\, OA welcomes you—no matter what your background\, belie
 fs\, or eating habits.\n\nWe hold an in-person newcomer meeting on **Sunda
 ys from 4:00 – 5:00 PM** **at Christ Church United Methodist\, 1717 Yulu
 pa Ave.\, Room #4\, Santa Rosa**. Contact: Abigail (707) 293-5888. You may
  view all North Bay OA in-person and online meetings at https://www.northb
 ayoa.org/meetings.html .\n\nIn OA\, members experience **spiritual\, emoti
 onal\, and physical recovery** by practicing the **Twelve Steps** and livi
 ng by their spiritual principles—one day at a time.\n\nOA is **not** a d
 iet club or calorie-counting program.\n\nMembers have different plans of e
 ating.\n\nOA does **not** endorse any specific food plan.\n\nIf food is ca
 using problems in your life\, you don’t have to struggle alone. Recovery
  is possible\, and help is available.\n\n**Visit:** https://www.northbayoa
 .org/\n\n**Find a meeting:** https://www.northbayoa.org/meetings.html
LOCATION:Christ Church United Methodist
URL:https://www.northbayoa.org/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://energywavecenter.com/sound-odyssey/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Sound Healing Odyssey
DTSTART;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260322T170000
DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260322T190000
UID:260303PBzUktpRzkGQxCx0vB3pzQ
DESCRIPTION:**Experience transpersonal states of consciousness\, pure blis
 s\, cessation of mind chatter\, accessing a full spectrum of emotions and 
 receiving highly intuitive “downloads” as you immerse yourself in Eost
 ar’s Sound Healing Odyssey.**\n\nRelease\, cleanse\, re-align body\, min
 d\, soul and spirit\, using these ancient tools. Eostar’s sound journeys
  are meditations guided by the sound of various instruments\, with varying
  frequencies and vibrations…most of which are rich in overtones that res
 onate deeply in one’s body and auric field. These overtones can lead one
  into a state of total relaxation in which healing and connection to a hig
 her consciousness usually happens spontaneously.\n\nEostar has played sacr
 ed acoustic music and sound healing music to audiences along the West Coas
 t and South America for more than two decades as a devotional musician and
  as sound healer.  She creates sound-scapes using didgeridoo\, tank-drums
 \, kalimbas\, drums\, monochord\, crystal bowls\, chimes\, Tibetan bowls\,
  guitar\, Gong and throat-singing.\n\nEostar is a Clinical Hypnotherapist 
 and breathwork teacher as well and she loves weaving these tools together 
 with the sound bath experience she orchestrates.\n\n**Begin your afternoon
  with a journey to the heart during Eostar’s group hypnosis event in the
  EESystem™  at 2 PM.** \n\n**GROUP HYPNOSIS**\n\nAbout EESystem™​\n
 \n**The EESystem™ is a ecologically & environmentally safe system used b
 y individuals\, doctors\, and therapists as well as Meditation and Wellnes
 s Centers to improve human development and psychological well-being.  Dec
 ades of documented research on the EESystem™ shows people experience im
 proved immune function\, relief from pain\, detoxification\, elevated mood
 s\, increased energy\, and much more.**\n\nAbout Eostar\n\n**Eostar Kamala
  is a multifaceted healer and musician\, specializing in therapeutic hypno
 sis\, transformational shadow work\, and sound healing. With certification
 s from the Hypnosis Motivation Institute as a Master Hypnotist and Hypnoth
 erapist\, she blends her extensive education—including breathwork facili
 tation and shamanic training—with her passion for guiding others through
  their inner journeys.**\n\n**Her spiritual awakening began at 19 in Hunga
 ry\, ignited by the wisdom of a local healer. This transformative experien
 ce led her to explore various healing modalities\, ultimately culminating 
 in the founding of "Shadow Into Light" Hypnotherapy. Eostar’s artistry r
 eflects her journey\; from sacred music performances to visual art represe
 nting her inner landscapes\, she channels universal love through every med
 ium.**\n\n**Now based in Mount Shasta’s energy vortex\, Eostar continues
  to evolve as a teacher and facilitator of plant medicine ceremonies while
  sharing her devotional music with the world. Her mission is to empower ot
 hers to embrace their own paths toward healing and self-discovery.**\n\n**
 Discover more about Eostar's multi-disciplinary acoustic talents at: Eosta
 r.net/sound-healing/**
LOCATION:Energy Wave Center 
URL:https://energywavecenter.com/sound-odyssey/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/last-supper-inspired-dinner/18111529/2026-03-22T18"}
