DESCRIPTION:In this class is about making sure you can do what you want to
  do\, for as long as you want to do it. It’s about creating that strong 
 foundation for a truly active lifestyle. Dance\, Exercise\, and Staying Fi
 t.\n\nlow impact\n\nbuilding muscles\n\nmovement\n\nconfidence\n\nWe focus
  on the most important things: building strong muscles using safe\, low-im
 pact movements. We’ll also dedicate time to flexibility and balance\, be
 cause true fitness isn’t just about strength—it’s about moving throu
 gh the world with ease and confidence.\n\nMy promise to you is that you’
 ll leave here feeling stronger\, more energized\, and ready to take on you
 r week. There’s no pressure\, just progress\, and we move at a pace that
  is right for everyone.\n\nBring your own weights \\(optional\\) \, find 
 our focus\, and commit to being Forever Fit!
LOCATION:Salsa Dance Marin
URL:https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/fit-forever/17285299/20
 26-03-24T14
