 ndly sewing program. We will be providing all materials\, and machines but
  if you already have any fabric you want to use\, please feel free to brin
 g it. Provided fabric consists of stable wovens such as quilting cotton. D
 ue to a limited number of sewing machines available at the library\, regis
 tration is required. If you have your own machine you would like to bring\
 , please let us know so we can set up the room properly to accomodate you.
  If you have any questions\, please call the library: \\(866\\) 572-7587. 
 If you are a kid interested in this program\, we will be hosting a kid's v
