SUMMARY: Fresh Pressed Flower Card Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Instructor: Jan Lochner\nSaturday\, March 28th\n2:00PM-5:00PM
 \nSanta Rosa Location\n$35.00\n\nThis is a hands on make and take class w
 here you will make at least five items including a bookmark\, a greeting 
 card\, a fridge magnet and an ornament. The class will use two different 
 techniques and Jan will explain how to press flowers and which flowers ho
 ld their color best. It is a creative experience!\n\n\nTo register for th
 is workshop\, please contact Jan at: freshpressedflowercards@yahoo.com ma
 ilto:freshpressedflowercards@yahoo.com\n\nCreating note cards from presse
 d flowers has been Jan’s hobby for 25 years\, though she has no formal ar
 t training. She utilizes color\,\nshape and texture on fine quality paper
 \, each card uniquely handmade. Jan’s home in Sebastopol is her studio: t
 he dining room table is her workshop\, the kitchen cupboards storing boxe
 s and trays of flowers. She buy card stock by the thousand and pick bloom
 s from her garden and other public places. Her family is used to me sayin
 g\, “could we stop for just a few minutes so I can gather some… ”\n\nIt i
 s a wonderful way of life.\n\n*A note to all students: Please park on in 
 the East facing parking lot while attending classes. We greatly appreciat
 e it. Thank you.
CATEGORIES:Santa-Rosa
