X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Luther Burbank Center": "https://lutherburbankcenter.org/event/becky-robinson26/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:luther_burbank_center
X-SOURCE:Luther Burbank Center
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260404T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260404T200000
DTSTAMP:20260302T183318
CREATED:20260109T140006Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260107T184053Z
UID:85374-1775332800-1775332800@lutherburbankcenter.org
SUMMARY:ICON Concerts Presents Becky Robinson: The Beasts In Me Tour
DESCRIPTION:Back to All Shows\n\n\nICON Concerts Presents \nBecky Robinson: The Beasts In Me Tour\n\nSaturday\, April 4\, 2026\n\n8:00 pm\n\n\nBUY TICKETS \nOriginally from Portland\, Oregon\, Becky Robinson is an LA-based comedian\, writer\, actor\, and voice-over star who has gone from viral sensation to a sold-out theater act. \nYou may also know her as the “Entitled Housewife\,” the outspoken viral golf character Robinson created to co-star in two self-produced virtual comedy variety specials that helped spread laughter during the pandemic. Her unique character antics and viral videos have racked up millions of views across social media and garnered fans across the country (and the country clubs). In 2022\, she released the original song “Mama Needs a Claw.” \n\n\nVIP Add-On Option: \n\nPost Event Meet & Greet\n\n\n\n \n\nTHIRD PARTY RESELLERS\nDon’t get taken by deceptive online resellers who use bots to buy tickets and then mark up their prices. The only safe way to protect your purchase and guarantee the best seats at the lowest cost is to work directly with us: through our website\, by phone\, or at our box office in Santa Rosa. Plus\, we’re not bots. Our friendly team members are easily accessible by phone or at the box office to provide customer support.
URL:https://lutherburbankcenter.org/event/becky-robinson26/
CATEGORIES:2025 - 2026 Season,Comedy
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://lutherburbankcenter.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/BeckyRobinson_TBIM_AdMat_square.jpg
END:VEVENT
