URL:https://www.meetup.com/sonoma-county-womens-wine-club/
UID:event_313452848@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260303T213750Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260419T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260419T160000
SUMMARY:Spring Fling Succulent Terrarium Class and Wine Tasting at Stuhlmu
 ller Vineyards
DESCRIPTION:Sonoma County Women's Wine Club (SCWWC)\nSpring has sprung her
 e in wine country!\n\nI have the pleasure of setting up a fantastic orb Te
 rrarium workshop offered through Flourish Petaluma and wine tasting at Stu
 hlmuller Vineyards in Geyserville.\n\nIf you haven't been to Stuhlmuller V
 ineyards\, you are in for a treat. They are a spacious and unique winery o
 pen to the public\, with a tasting room and vineyards in Alexander Valley.
  They specialize in Pinot Noir\, Cabernet Sauvignon\, Zinfandel\, and Char
 donnay. You are welcome to purchase wine outside of the tasting provided.\
 n\n**Get ready for a hands-on\, creative workshop where you'll dive into t
 he art of designing and caring for succulents.**\n\nWe will be arranging i
 ndividual terrariums\, chatting\, and sampling wine for 2-3 hours. You wil
 l have the option to choose from a wide variety of succulents\, colorful p
 ebbles\, and vibrant mosses to personalize your own Orb Terrarium. Brandi\
 , the owner of Flourish will provide expert guidance\, care tips\, and ple
 nty of hands-on support throughout the process. Everyone will be able to t
 ake their terrariums home after the event.\n\nThere is a minimum of 10 peo
 ple needed\, a maximum of 20 people\, plus this is a Co-ed event\, so both
  men and women are welcome. Your spot is reserved by prepaying for your ti
 cket through Paypal and the Meetup website.\n\nThe cost of the event is $8
 6\, which includes the wine tasting\, our club fee of $1\, terrarium mater
 ials and guidance on succulents\, plus care tips. We are asking that you r
 eserve your spot by prepaying just for the terrarium workshop\, which is $
 60. You can pay for the wine tasting there\, expected cost is $26.\n\nGues
 ts are welcome\, they will need to pre-pay as well. I suggest you wear lay
 ers as we will be outside\, and sometimes the weather is windy or cold. Pl
 ease allow extra time to get there\, the vineyard is about 5 miles from th
 e Highway 101 exit at Lytton. We will confirm headcount about a week befor
 e.\n\nCheers to this fun succulent event!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/sonoma-county-womens-wine-club/events
 /313452848/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260220T223726Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260220T223726Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
