 meeting 6 Tuesdays 10:30AM-1:00PM Location: Santa Rosa Store $270.00 *Add
 itional: Separate $20.00 plus tax...
LOCATION:Rileystreet Art Supply\,103 Maxwell Ct\, Santa Rosa\, CA 95401\,
  USA
