SUMMARY:Roustabout Theater’s Apprentice Program Presents Cabaret
DESCRIPTION:Back to All Shows\n\n\nRoustabout Theater’s Apprentice Program Presents\nCabaret\nSaturday\, May 9\, 2026\, at 2:00 pm and 7:30 pm\nSunday\, May 10\, 2026\, at 2:00 pm\n\n\n\nBuy Tickets for May 9 at 2:00 pm\nBuy Tickets for May 9 at 7:30 pm\nBuy Tickets for May 10 at 2:00 pm \nWillkommen\, Bienvenue\, Welcome to Cabaret! It’s 1930 Berlin\, and inside the Kit Kat Klub the delirious party rages on\, even as forces on the outside gather strength. But what can Sally\, Cliff\, Kost\, Ludwig and the Emcee do about that? Come…Join Roustabout Theater’s Apprentice Program in our home in the Carston Cabaret as we dive into this carefree atmosphere with Kander and Ebb’s iconic score – including “Maybe This Time”\, “Mein Herr”\, “Two Ladies”\, “Don’t Tell Mama”\, “Cabaret” – and\, for the first time\, featuring two actors from Roustabout’s Professional Ensemble: Bill Davis as Herr Schultz and and Loretta Janka as Fraulein Schneider. This is a party you won’t soon forget. Leave your troubles outside and…Welcome! \nRoustabout Theater is the longest running Resident Theater at the LBC offering both our Professional Ensemble performances utilizing professional talent from across the Bay Area and our award-winning Apprentice Program\, a leading training program for actors and stage managers ages 11 – 20. \n\n\n \n\nTHIRD PARTY RESELLERS\nDon’t get taken by deceptive online resellers who use bots to buy tickets and then mark up their prices. The only safe way to protect your purchase and guarantee the best seats at the lowest cost is to work directly with us: through our website\, by phone\, or at our box office in Santa Rosa. Plus\, we’re not bots. Our friendly team members are easily accessible by phone or at the box office to provide customer support.
URL:https://lutherburbankcenter.org/event/roustabout-cabaret26/
CATEGORIES:2025 - 2026 Season,Theatre
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://lutherburbankcenter.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/EBLAST-LBC.jpg
END:VEVENT
