URL:https://tockify.com/rileystreet.art.com/detail/432/1778607000000
SUMMARY: Watercolor Fundamentals Part 1
DESCRIPTION:Instructor: Anne Millett\n\nThis is a 6-class series\, meetin
 g 6 Tuesdays\n10:30AM-1:00PM\nLocation: Santa Rosa Store\n$270.00\n\n\n*A
 dditional: Separate $20.00 plus tax Materials Fee paid to Anne at the fir
 st class\, for the high-quality Arches #140 cold press watercolor paper. 
 Brushes\, palettes\, high-quality watercolor paint\, and set-ups for use 
 during class will be provided.*\n\nThere will be a materials fee of $15 p
 lus tax for the series.\n\n\nWatercolor Fundamentals - Part 1\n\nThis cla
 ss focuses on the simple delight of mixing color with water\, brushing it
  on paper\, and watching what happens as it moves and dries. You will lea
 rn easy ways to create paintings that are all about color and the sometim
 es unpredictable nature of water.\n\nNo drawing skills are needed.\n\nIn 
 this class we will explore the basic principles of watercolor painting. L
 earn or refresh your understanding of brush handling\, brush care and set
 ting up\, the benefits of “good paper”\, watercolor lights and darks\, fl
 at and graded washes\, wet-on-wet techniques such as charging\, wet-on-dr
 y techniques such as glazing\, color wheel\, color theory\, color mixing\
 , and more. Simple applications of these techniques invite you to experim
 ent and play.\n\nThis class is designed for adults 18+\n\n$270 for 6 clas
 ses\, 2.5 hours each class\nPayable via check\, cash\, or Zelle.\n\n*Brus
 hes\, palettes\, set-ups\, and paint will be provided.*\n\n\nTo see Anne'
 s work and to learn more about this class\, please visit her website at: 
 http://www.miraaster.com https://www.miraaster.com/ www.miraaster.com\n\n
 \nTo register for this workshop\, please contact Anne by email at: classe
 s@miraaster.com mailto:classes@miraaster.com mailto:amillett@gmail.com
CATEGORIES:Santa-Rosa,Watercolor
X-TKF-FEATURED-IMAGE:https://d3flpus5evl89n.cloudfront.net/640bcf85795edf
 4fa3769ae5/652aed378bbc014a065e4371/scaled_1024.jpg
