X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Uptowntheatrenapa": "https://www.uptowntheatrenapa.com/event/adam-ray/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:uptowntheatrenapa
X-SOURCE:Uptowntheatrenapa
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260516T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260516T200000
DTSTAMP:20260302T145213
CREATED:20260127T184827Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260127T190805Z
UID:25547-1778961600-1778961600@www.uptowntheatrenapa.com
SUMMARY:Adam Ray
DESCRIPTION:May 16\, 2026\nPURCHASE TICKETS HERE  \nDoors 7pm/ Show 8pm\nAges: 18+ \nAdam Ray is a seasoned comedian and actor hailing from Seattle\, renowned for his versatile performances across television\, film\, and digital platforms. His extensive acting credits include roles in critically acclaimed shows and movies such as Curb Your Enthusiasm\, The Barbie Movie\, MadTV\, Hacks\, Pam & Tommy\, and The Heat\, among many others. \nIn addition to his prolific work in traditional media\, Adam has made significant strides in the digital space and live performances. His appearances on popular podcasts like Kill Tony\, Bad Friends\, and Two Bears\, One Cave have garnered millions of views\, with some episodes ranking among the most-watched in the shows’ histories. \nAdam’s talent for impressions and character work shines through his portrayals of iconic figures like Joe Biden\, Dr. Phil\, and original characters such as Elaine\, and Jeremy. These performances have not only captivated audiences but also contributed to the rapid growth of his YouTube and social channels\, where his content continues to reach an ever-expanding audience. \nOne of Adam’s standout achievements was his July 16th performance on Kill Tony\, which not only captivated viewers but also shattered records\, amassing over 15 million views within the first week. This episode has since become the most popular in the show’s history. Riding the wave of his success\, Adam is taking his show\, Dr. Phil LIVE!\, on a national theater tour\, offering fans an electrifying mix of stand-up\, crowd interactions\, celebrity guests\, surprise characters\, and unforgettable moments. His recent comedy special\, Like and Subscribe\, has further solidified his status as a must-watch performer. \nAs Adam continues to tour across the country and internationally\, he remains one of the most dynamic and entertaining figures in comedy today\, consistently delivering performances that leave audiences eagerly anticipating what’s next.
URL:https://www.uptowntheatrenapa.com/event/adam-ray/
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.uptowntheatrenapa.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/AR_1200X800.jpeg
END:VEVENT
