BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Luther Burbank Center": "https://lutherburbankcenter.org/event/voces-y-pasos26/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:luther_burbank_center
X-SOURCE:Luther Burbank Center
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260528T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260528T190000
DTSTAMP:20260302T183319
CREATED:20251118T140006Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20251113T215142Z
UID:83678-1779994800-1779994800@lutherburbankcenter.org
SUMMARY:LBC’s Afterschool Mariachi and Ballet Folklórico programs present 2nd Annual Voces y Pasos: A Cultural Celebration
DESCRIPTION:Back to All Shows\n\n\nLBC’s Afterschool Mariachi and Ballet Folklórico programs present\n2nd Annual Voces y Pasos: A Cultural Celebration\n\nThursday\, May 28\, 2026\n\n7:00 pm\n\n\nBUY TICKETS \nCelebrate the rich cultural traditions of Mexico through the vibrant artistry of the musicians and dancers in LBC’s afterschool Marichi and Ballet Folklórico programs at Voces y Pasos (Voices and Steps): A Cultural Celebration. Featuring more than 150 of Sonoma County’s talented youth\, Voces y Pasos brings these traditions and celebrations to life in an unforgettable stage performance that pays tribute to their Mexican heritage. \nLBC’s Mariachi Ensemble and its sister program\, LBC’s Ballet Folklórico\, enroll students from all over the county. Together they deliver stunning performances that blend technical skill\, stage presence\, and heartfelt expression while embodying the grace and vibrancy of traditional Mexican folk music and dance. \nThe young performers in these programs devote themselves to weekly rehearsals and regular performances at community events that continue to shape them into impressive artists. Thanks to the generosity of our donors and sponsors\, they can participate at no cost to their families\, with all equipment and costumes provided. Join us for an inspiring evening that shines the spotlight on the voices and steps of these talented students and honors the enduring power of culture\, tradition\, and community. \n\n\n \n\nTHIRD PARTY RESELLERS\nDon’t get taken by deceptive online resellers who use bots to buy tickets and then mark up their prices. The only safe way to protect your purchase and guarantee the best seats at the lowest cost is to work directly with us: through our website\, by phone\, or at our box office in Santa Rosa. Plus\, we’re not bots. Our friendly team members are easily accessible by phone or at the box office to provide customer support.
URL:https://lutherburbankcenter.org/event/voces-y-pasos26/
CATEGORIES:2025 - 2026 Season,Special Presentation
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://lutherburbankcenter.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Voces-y-Pasos_SquareImage_1000x1000.jpg
END:VEVENT
