SUMMARY: Fresh Pressed Flower Card Workshop Level 2
DESCRIPTION:Instructor: Jan Lochner\nSaturday\, May 30th\n2:00PM-5:00PM\n
 Santa Rosa Location\n$35.00\n\nThis class requires that students have tak
 en the introductory class which focuses mostly on techniques of construct
 ion of various items. We will make some of the same items but with a focu
 s on composition\, simplicity\, color combinations\, color enhancement an
 d the principles of design. We will add a votive candle to be covered in 
 tissue paper and flowers. Class critique and comments are essential.\n\n\
 nTo register for this workshop\, please contact Jan at: freshpressedflowe
 rcards@yahoo.com mailto:freshpressedflowercards@yahoo.com mailto:freshpre
 ssedflowercards@yahoo.com\n\nCreating note cards from pressed flowers has
  been Jan’s hobby for 25 years\, though she has no formal art training. S
 he utilizes color\,\nshape and texture on fine quality paper\, each card 
 uniquely handmade. Jan’s home in Sebastopol is her studio: the dining roo
 m table is her workshop\, the kitchen cupboards storing boxes and trays o
 f flowers. She buy card stock by the thousand and pick blooms from her ga
 rden and other public places. Her family is used to me saying\, “could we
  stop for just a few minutes so I can gather some… ”\n\nIt is a wonderful
  way of life.\n\n*A note to all students: Please park on in the East faci
 ng parking lot while attending classes. We greatly appreciate it. Thank y
 ou.
CATEGORIES:Santa-Rosa
