SUMMARY:Amplify & PMG Presentan Eden Muñoz: Como En Los Viejos Tiempos Tour 2025 Rescheduled Date: Friday\, August 7\, 2026
DESCRIPTION:Back to All Shows\n\n\nAmplify & PMG Presentan\nEden Muñoz: Como En Los Viejos Tiempos Tour 2025\n\n\nRescheduled Date: Friday\, August 7\, 2026\nThe previous performance date was\nSunday\, September 21\, 2025\n\n7:00 pm\n\n\nBUY TICKETS \nRegional Mexican singer/songwriter Eden is solidifying his place among the top Mexican music artist\, with approximately 12 million monthly listeners on Spotify\, over 5 million followers on Facebook\, 4 million on Instagram\, and more than 5.5 million on TikTok. In 2006\, at just 16 years old\, Eden Muñoz started his musical career as the lead vocalist of the group Colmillo Norteño. After performing with a number of bands\, in 2022\, he officially launched his solo career with the single “Chale\,” becoming one of the breakout artists of that year. \nHis latest single titled “Traigo Saldo y Ganas de Rogar” has served as a key driver for Eden Muñoz’s career development in 2024. This track is part of his third studio album Eden\, which fully reflects his essence through complete creative freedom. \n\n\n \n\nTHIRD PARTY RESELLERS\nDon’t get taken by deceptive online resellers who use bots to buy tickets and then mark up their prices. The only safe way to protect your purchase and guarantee the best seats at the lowest cost is to work directly with us: through our website\, by phone\, or at our box office in Santa Rosa. Plus\, we’re not bots. Our friendly team members are easily accessible by phone or at the box office to provide customer support.
URL:https://lutherburbankcenter.org/event/eden-munoz25/
CATEGORIES:2025 - 2026 Season,Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://lutherburbankcenter.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Eden-Munoz-Square.jpg
END:VEVENT
