SUMMARY:EvolvePlusTV.com Presents: Psychic Medium John Edward
DESCRIPTION:Back to All Shows\n\n\nEvolvePlusTV.com Presents\nPsychic Medium John Edward\n\nSunday\, January 9\, 2027\n\n7:00 pm\n\n\nBUY TICKETS \nJohn Edward is one of the world’s most sought-after psychic mediums and author of several critically acclaimed New York Times best sellers\, including Crossing Over: The Stories Behind the Stories\, After Life: Answers from the Other Side\, and Infinite Quest. Don’t miss this intimate event! \n\n\nVIP tickets Seating is closest to the stage. Each ticket includes a one-month Evolve Plus premium subscription. Your subscription will be activated after the event. For information on what’s included in the subscription please go to www.evolveplustv.com Also included in the as a VIP is the opportunity to stay after the event for a conversation\, question and answer session with John and the other VIPs. This event lasts a minimum of 20 minutes right after the regular event. In addition to the live event\, VIPs will be given access to a special virtual event you can participate in from the comfort of your home ($100 value). That’s two events for the price of one. Prior to the event on January 11th\, VIP ticket holders will be emailed by John’s office and will need to reply to the email to activate their VIP benefits. \n\n\n \n\nTHIRD PARTY RESELLERS\nDon’t get taken by deceptive online resellers who use bots to buy tickets and then mark up their prices. The only safe way to protect your purchase and guarantee the best seats at the lowest cost is to work directly with us: through our website\, by phone\, or at our box office in Santa Rosa. Plus\, we’re not bots. Our friendly team members are easily accessible by phone or at the box office to provide customer support.
